==== hyperbricks yaml {!{js}} ====
js:
  - type: javascript
  - attributes:
      type: text/javascript
  - file: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/script.js
==== explainer ====
Extra attributes like id, data-role, data-action, type
==== expected json ====
